@startuml STATE-03-web-conversion-session
title STATE-03 - Web Conversion Workspace Session

hide empty description

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam stateBorderThickness 1
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor white
    BorderColor black
    FontColor black
}

[*] --> Ready : Open Web Workspace

Ready --> Editing : Enter Markdown
Ready --> Restoring : Upload PDF

Restoring --> Editing : Source Extracted
Restoring --> Ready : Extraction Error

Editing --> Compiling : Convert to PDF
Compiling --> Editing : Compilation Error
Compiling --> Preview : Build Success

Preview --> Downloading : Click Download
Downloading --> Preview : File Saved

Preview --> Editing : Edit Content
Preview --> Ready : Reset Session

Ready --> [*] : Close Session
Editing --> [*] : Close Session

@enduml